    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_metals_semi_finished; wd_term=coin; wd_relation=skos:closeMatch): Coin and platina (platinum) belong with precious metals and bullion. Verified Wikidata anchor retained as closeMatch (the heading is the plural trade article). Layer-1 observations: 14 rows, 1893–1897. Series: CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×14. Units: (no unit) ×14. Top routes: Canada → United States ×2; Canada → All Countries ×2; Quebec → All Countries ×2; Nova Scotia → All Countries ×2."@en ;
